# Dev-flow workspace artifacts (auto-generated)
workspaces/current-workspace
workspaces/*/session/conversations/

# Release artifacts
*.dmg

# 覆盖率门禁的本地中间产物（CI 在仓库根跑 coverage_gate.py 读取它，
